155
00:06:56,259 --> 00:06:58,394
Drop the act.
I know you're friends.

156
00:06:58,495 --> 00:06:59,795
Hey.

157
00:06:59,896 --> 00:07:01,497
When you guys chat,
does she ever mention

158
